among us until the test.

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.345
Good luck to us all!

00:14:26.765 --> 00:14:29.461
Wh.. What is this?

00:14:42.915 --> 00:14:44.917
Let's pretend I didn't see that.

00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:45.975
Huh?

00:15:02.334 --> 00:15:06.395
XY equals...

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.913
Finally, it's the day of the test!

00:15:13.913 --> 00:15:15.080
Yeah...

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.017
What's the matter? You look tired.

00:15:18.017 --> 00:15:19.885
A couple things have become
very clear to me:

00:15:19.885 --> 00:15:22.388
How painful it is to be forced
to do something you can't ,

00:15:22.388 --> 00:15:25.482
and the fact that none of us has
any talent when it comes to cooking.

00:15:25.824 --> 00:15:29.395
Yuki, I don't ever wanna catch
you cooking again.

00:15:29.395 --> 00:15:31.297
You guys are so mean!

00:15:31.297 --> 00:15:34.755
Sunako is the only one who ate all my food.

00:15:35.067 --> 00:15:36.769
Sunako ate that?!

00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:38.066
Y.. Yeah...

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:40.439
You mean, that murderous dish you made?!

00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:42.408
It wasn't that bad!

00:15:42.408 --> 00:15:44.510
Even you couldn't eat it, remember?

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:46.034
Oh, that's right.

00:15:50.149 --> 00:15:52.174
This is so painful...

00:15:53.052 --> 00:15:55.247
My stomach hurts...

00:15:55.754 --> 00:15:57.278
Begin the test.

00:16:00.659 --> 00:16:02.286
Huh? What's wrong?

00:16:10.202 --> 00:16:11.169
Hey!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.537
I give up!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.077
It's over!

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.249
Sunako, is your stomach okay?

00:16:24.249 --> 00:16:26.986
It's not hurting anymore, but I'm sleepy.

00:16:26.986 --> 00:16:29.788
Sunako, can I see your test paper?

00:16:29.788 --> 00:16:30.956
Here.

00:16:30.956 --> 00:16:33.322
Thank God, it's over!

00:16:33.392 --> 00:16:35.223
It's over! It's over!

00:16:37.129 --> 00:16:38.790
Now I can have some fun!

00:16:39.164 --> 00:16:41.667
Kyohei is back!

00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:45.000
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

00:16:45.371 --> 00:16:47.706
Su.. Sunako, this is...

00:16:47.706 --> 00:16:49.008
Huh? What's up?

00:16:49.008 --> 00:16:51.443
These calculating formulas on the test paper...

00:16:51.443 --> 00:16:54.013
You did these to get the answers, right?

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:55.347
Yeah, I guess.

00:16:55.347 --> 00:16:57.247
She might get a hundred.

00:16:57.616 --> 00:16:59.311
A hundred?!

00:16:59.518 --> 00:17:02.554
This is great, Sunako! You did it!

00:17:02.554 --> 00:17:05.224
Your overall GPA wasn't anything eXtraordinary
because of your math score, but now

00:17:05.224 --> 00:17:07.886
it's going to be way beyond eXtraordinary,
not just that, but at the top of our class even!

00:17:07.993 --> 00:17:08.891
beyond eXtraordinary

00:17:09.161 --> 00:17:10.496
way beyond eXtraordinary

00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:14.600
way beyond eXtraordinary
Kiss... Kiss...

00:17:16.802 --> 00:17:18.770
Kiss!

00:17:26.111 --> 00:17:27.579
Sunako snapped!

00:17:27.579 --> 00:17:29.911
She must have remembered the
whole kissing thing again!

00:17:33.352 --> 00:17:34.286
The Road to Womanhood!

00:17:34.286 --> 00:17:35.954
The Road to Womanhood!
The Road to Womanhood!

00:17:35.954 --> 00:17:36.784
The Road to Womanhood!

00:17:37.656 --> 00:17:39.624
This is how to kiss beautifully!

00:17:40.192 --> 00:17:43.161
I wonder if my nose will
bump into his nose?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.800
When you kiss someone,
don't close your eyes suddenly,

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:49.868
but try to stare at the other person's lips

00:17:49.868 --> 00:17:51.859
right up until the moment your lips
touch the other person's lips.

00:17:52.438 --> 00:17:56.841
If you do that, you will look very
sexy to the other person.

00:17:57.109 --> 00:17:58.872
Aren't you embarrassed to even
say something like that?!

00:17:58.944 --> 00:18:00.571
Huh? Why would I be?

00:18:02.014 --> 00:18:04.847
The Road to Womanhood!
To Be Continued

00:18:09.555 --> 00:18:11.056
She went down!

00:18:11.056 --> 00:18:12.057
After her!

00:18:12.057 --> 00:18:12.853
Okay!

00:18:14.193 --> 00:18:15.461
She's going up!

00:18:15.461 --> 00:18:16.462
After her!

00:18:16.462 --> 00:18:17.360
Okay!

00:18:17.796 --> 00:18:18.831
Sunako!

00:18:18.831 --> 00:18:20.298
Wait up!

00:18:28.107 --> 00:18:30.075
Hey, Sunako Nakahara!

00:18:30.075 --> 00:18:31.167
Sunako!

00:18:31.777 --> 00:18:35.948
Whether I remember it or not,
I can't change my past!

00:18:35.948 --> 00:18:40.519
Whether I smile or cry, it won't change the
fact that I kissed a Creature of Light!

00:18:40.519 --> 00:18:44.289
Whether I like it or not, that's the truth!
That's the reality!

00:18:44.289 --> 00:18:48.157
Whatever! Is a kiss that big of a deal?!

00:18:48.627 --> 00:18:50.094
Of course it is!

00:18:50.429 --> 00:18:51.864
"Baiser" ...

00:18:51.864 --> 00:18:55.334
A sweet temptation, that could
melt your body and mind...

00:18:55.334 --> 00:19:00.172
A fragrant, forbidden fruit that beckons
you along the path to ecstasy...

00:19:00.172 --> 00:19:01.969
What you're talking about is...

00:19:02.474 --> 00:19:03.771
Sunako!

00:19:04.309 --> 00:19:05.978
Don't do anything stupid!

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:09.414
Now that I've been eroded by
the Creature of Light

00:19:09.414 --> 00:19:11.382
my life isn't even worth living.

00:19:11.683 --> 00:19:14.720
Hiroshi... Akira... Josephine...

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.813
I'm sorry for turning my back
on the Darkness!

00:19:17.189 --> 00:19:19.825
Yuki, go to the chemical lab and grab John!

00:19:19.825 --> 00:19:21.393
What? Why?

00:19:21.393 --> 00:19:22.928
Just go and get it!

00:19:22.928 --> 00:19:24.096
Okay!

00:19:24.096 --> 00:19:27.031
Stop the theatrics, it was just a little kiss!

00:19:27.332 --> 00:19:29.101
You're right!

00:19:29.101 --> 00:19:32.264
For a person like you,
it was just a kiss, wasn't it?

00:19:32.504 --> 00:19:33.972
What did you just say?

00:19:33.972 --> 00:19:35.007
Kyohei!

00:19:35.007 --> 00:19:37.676
So, it's really true that you kissed Nakahara?!

00:19:37.676 --> 00:19:38.810
Do it to me too!

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:39.777
Me too!

00:19:40.045 --> 00:19:40.145
Shut up!

00:19:40.145 --> 00:19:41.547
Shut up!
Shut up!

00:19:41.547 --> 00:19:42.206
Shut up!

00:19:42.514 --> 00:19:45.617
Kyohei told me that people
would ambush him

00:19:45.617 --> 00:19:50.355
and steal his lips on a daily basis
when he was in middle school.

00:19:50.355 --> 00:19:53.825
Supposedly, police used to escort him back to
his house when the situation got out of hand.

00:19:53.825 --> 00:19:55.190
That's unbelievable...

00:19:55.394 --> 00:19:58.297
You worked really hard for the test
instead of running away from it!

00:19:58.297 --> 00:20:00.197
I give you credit for that.

00:20:00.365 --> 00:20:03.335
But what the hell now? A kiss?!

00:20:03.335 --> 00:20:05.437
So, what, you already found another
reason to run away?

00:20:05.437 --> 00:20:06.904
Stop it! Don't say that!

00:20:07.139 --> 00:20:09.369
Listen! Kisses are...

00:20:12.444 --> 00:20:13.468
Kyohei!

00:20:24.623 --> 00:20:27.148
A kiss is as simple as this!

00:20:27.793 --> 00:20:31.559
If there's no love in it, it means nothing!

00:20:42.307 --> 00:20:43.501
Oh, I see.

00:20:47.913 --> 00:20:51.508
Cripes! Drama follows you
everywhere you friggin' go!

00:20:51.883 --> 00:20:53.485
I'm glad she's safe.

00:20:53.485 --> 00:20:57.189
Even if she got a perfect score on the test,
it'd be meaningless if she were dead!

00:20:57.189 --> 00:20:59.925
Sunako, you can do anything if you
put your mind to it, can't you?

00:20:59.925 --> 00:21:02.461
How hard did you study for it anyway?

00:21:02.461 --> 00:21:05.487
I just memorized the paper
you guys made for me.

00:21:05.564 --> 00:21:06.698
Huh?

00:21:06.698 --> 00:21:09.667
The numbers were a little different,
so it was a pain, but...

00:21:10.035 --> 00:21:13.402
Damn! Did you get a hundred that easily?!

00:21:14.306 --> 00:21:16.740
Because I don't like adding and subtracting.

00:21:16.808 --> 00:21:22.180
Why you! Do you have any idea what I had to
put up with so I could cram for that test?!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.783
Kyohei! Now you're just taking it out on her!

00:21:24.783 --> 00:21:27.052
I don't like multiplication
or division either.

00:21:27.052 --> 00:21:31.456
Let me go! Damn it! I'm gonna find out
what it looks like inside her brain!

00:21:31.456 --> 00:21:32.923
Nakahara!

00:21:33.292 --> 00:21:35.726
I... I...

00:21:36.628 --> 00:21:38.864
He's crying because he's so overwhelmed!

00:21:38.864 --> 00:21:40.632
I am... sad.

00:21:40.632 --> 00:21:41.533
What?

00:21:41.533 --> 00:21:45.771
All the answers are correct, but you put
your answers all off by one row!

00:21:45.771 --> 00:21:48.171
So you got another three!

00:21:48.273 --> 00:21:49.141
3 POINTS

00:21:49.141 --> 00:21:51.510
3 POINTS
A three...

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:51.843
3 POINTS

00:21:51.843 --> 00:21:54.607
You bastard! What about the rent now?

00:21:56.315 --> 00:21:57.942
I'm very sad too!

00:21:58.216 --> 00:22:00.285
Sheesh, this is pathetic.

00:22:00.285 --> 00:22:02.020
We don't wanna hear that from you!

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:02.884
Tee-hee!

00:22:02.988 --> 00:22:05.422
I'm Up To My Kisser In Study Materials

00:22:06.591 --> 00:22:11.153
What I managed to obliterate

00:22:14.232 --> 00:22:20.569
Was a bunch of blades

00:22:21.873 --> 00:22:29.245
I loved it like this, waiting, waiting

00:22:29.715 --> 00:22:36.951
With felt petals, waiting

00:22:37.622 --> 00:22:44.994
I can't see you anymore, waiting, waiting

00:22:45.731 --> 00:22:53.438
I just keep on waiting in a sea without you

00:22:53.438 --> 00:23:00.844
I loved it like this, waiting, waiting

00:23:01.113 --> 00:23:08.246
The felt petals, waiting

00:23:08.887 --> 00:23:12.157
We won't see each other anymore

00:23:12.157 --> 00:23:16.389
Waiting, waiting

00:23:17.129 --> 00:23:25.093
I will probably be waiting in a sea without you

00:23:30.942 --> 00:23:32.377
The big event in December is...

00:23:32.377 --> 00:23:32.878
A memorial service for broken needles!

00:23:32.878 --> 00:23:33.412
That's too lame!
A memorial service for broken needles!

00:23:33.412 --> 00:23:34.279
Reindeers and you know!

00:23:34.279 --> 00:23:35.347
Red nose? Puberty?

00:23:35.347 --> 00:23:35.914
Don't start it!

00:23:35.914 --> 00:23:37.416
You know the one who's
wearing the red outfit!

00:23:37.416 --> 00:23:38.049
Throb, throb?

00:23:38.049 --> 00:23:38.950
Why would you take my clothes off?!

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:40.485
Do you want the blue one or red one?

00:23:40.485 --> 00:23:41.953
It's a monster wearing a mask!

00:23:41.953 --> 00:23:43.221
I don't get it!

00:23:43.221 --> 00:23:44.956
Next time on The Wallflower:
" Oh, My Sweet Home!"

00:23:44.956 --> 00:23:46.591
See you guys next year!

